# CODEOWNERS
# ガバナンス経路の所有者。Ruleset / branch protection と組合せ、
# ADR-0012 / ADR-0003 で要求される review / approval の anchor を構成する。
#
# 編集の前に:
# 1. AGENTS.md §10–§17 を読み直す（governance skeleton）
# 2. docs/architecture/decisions/ で当該領域 ADR を確認する
# 3. 変更が対応する Issue に紐付いているかを Draft PR 作成前に確認する

# Default owners (project-wide) — Repository owner / initial gate.
# Change this when the repository adopts a second owner.
*                     @rebuildup

# Governance documents require a tracker + ADR cross-reference
/AGENTS.md            @rebuildup
/docs/                @rebuildup
/adr/                 @rebuildup

# Architecture / ADR / research
/docs/architecture/   @rebuildup
/docs/architecture/decisions/ @rebuildup
/docs/architecture/research/  @rebuildup

# Skill specs (canonical skill input)
/skills/              @rebuildup

# CI / GitHub configuration
/.github/workflows/   @rebuildup
/.github/CODEOWNERS   @rebuildup

# Experiments — runtime bridge probes are security-sensitive (loopback only
# token), so they belong with the repository owner.
/experiments/         @rebuildup

# Notes for future expansion:
# - When the project adopts a second human owner, add a second column.
# - When CODEOWNERS is used by branch protection (require review from Code Owners),
#   ADR-0012 continues to require explicit human authorization for release PR merge.
